==========================================================================================
CLAIM A — per-momentum trace
==========================================================================================
sum_a Tr(Sigma_a P_+ Sigma_a P_+) = 2*(3*m**2 + p_x**2 + p_y**2 + p_z**2)/(m**2 + p_x**2 + p_y**2 + p_z**2)
claimed 2 + 4 m^2/E^2            = 4*m**2/(m**2 + p_x**2 + p_y**2 + p_z**2) + 2
CLAIM_A_VERIFIED = True
  depends on p?   True
  value at p=0    6
  value at m=0    2
  -> it is 6 at p=0 and 2 at m=0, so it is NOT a constant and may not leave the integral

